Replace `YOUR_DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN_HERE` with your actual Discord bot token, and `YOUR_DISCORD_CLIENT_ID_HERE` with your actual Discord client ID.

6. Save all files and run the following command in your terminal to start your Discord bot:

